; abnf stdio.semio.value diff (REAL binary payload, upgraded from the old print_diff-bytes-
; verbatim shortcut)
; format u8 + presence u8 (bit0=root present, bit1=nodes present) fixed header, then 0-2
; back-to-back LEB128-varint-framed SemioValueDiff/nodes-diff payloads as one opaque OCTET
; chain -- real Rust-side recursion, opaque only at this description layer. See
; ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the equivalent tag-prefixed text shape.
document = format presence payload
format = OCTET
presence = OCTET
payload = *OCTET
